    "ODT: on-die termination control; ZQ: external RZQ (240 ohm) calibration reference; RESET_n.",
    "VDD = 1.2 V, VDDQ = 1.2 V, VPP = 2.5 V, VREFCA; VREFDQ generated internally (on-die)."
