    "Single 64-bit (72-bit ECC) data channel per module; x4/x8/x16 device organizations; double data rate on DQS_t/DQS_c edges.",
    "VDD = VDDQ = 1.2 V (VPP = 2.5 V) — reduced from DDR3's 1.5 V.",
    "Bank Groups (4 bank groups x 4 banks = 16 banks for x4/x8; 2 x 4 = 8 for x16) with short/long bank-group timings (tCCD_S/tCCD_L, tRRD_S/tRRD_L, tWTR_S/tWTR_L) — new in DDR4.",
